      "source": "Provide some options via the callback by modifying the given <a href=\"ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder</code></a>. Previously\ndefined options like a <a href=\"ReactiveChangeStreamOperation.ResumingChangeStream.html#resumeAfter(java.lang.Object)\"><code>resumeToken</code></a> are carried over to the\nbuilder and can be overwritten via eg. <a href=\"ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder.html#resumeToken(org.bson.BsonValue)\"><code>ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder.resumeToken(BsonValue)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通过修改给定的<a href=\"ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder</code></a>，您可以通过回调提供多种选项。先前定义的选项（如<a href=\"ReactiveChangeStreamOperation.ResumingChangeStream.html#resumeAfter(java.lang.Object)\"><code>resumeToken</code></a>）会被传递到构建器中，并可以通过例如<a href=\"ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder.html#resumeToken(org.bson.BsonValue)\"><code>ChangeStreamOptions.ChangeStreamOptionsBuilder.resumeToken(BsonValue)</code></a>进行覆盖。",
      "count": 1
